  title: Wind Chimes
  description: " Want never to hear your own thoughts again? Perfect - it\u2019s
    WIND CHIMES time. "
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 553197aa14e854c438b5da4e33b1c25a, type: 3}
  materials:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3691b9bc42637f4f95826822788bdc3, type: 2}
