  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a32758e9fdc4ed44b78e4d8e5b9a95a, type: 2}
  itemUses:
  - 'I love the way they play music in the wind! '
  - 'I want to start decorating my place - it feels so empty. '
  - 'the sound calms me down when I am stressed. '
  - 'I heard they keep away bad spirits - or maybe even noisy seagulls. '
  - 'they remind me of my childhood home. '
